---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<footer class="kota-pattern relative border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-white">
  <div class="tricolor-bar h-[3px] w-full"></div>
  <div class="container-site grid gap-10 py-14 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-1"><div class="font-display text-2xl font-bold">Explore<span class="text-brand-400">Gabon</span></div><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Une plateforme pensée pour découvrir les destinations et expériences touristiques du Gabon.</p><p class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Mbolo — bienvenue, un mot de fang, l'une des langues du Gabon</p></div>
    <div><h2 class="font-bold">Explorer</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400"><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}destinations/`}>Destinations</a><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}experiences/`}>Expériences</a><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}regions/`}>Régions</a><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}favoris/`}>Favoris</a></div></div>
    <div><h2 class="font-bold">Compte</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400"><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}connexion/`}>Connexion</a><a class="block hover:text-white" href={`${base}inscription/`}>Créer un compte</a></div></div>
    <div><h2 class="font-bold">Identité</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400"><span class="block">🇬🇦 Vert, jaune, bleu</span><span class="block">Motifs inspirés de l'art Kota</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-5 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">© {new Date().getFullYear()} ExploreGabon</div>
</footer>
